  "description": "Dependency-free PDF reader and rasterizer for DocWright. Parses an arbitrary PDF — cross-reference tables and streams, the object graph, stream filters, content streams, colour spaces and embedded font programs — and renders pages to PNG or JPEG. Also assembles pages: delete, extract, reorder, merge, split and duplicate pages of existing PDFs into a new file, without rasterizing or re-encoding a stream, with links, named destinations, outlines and page labels repaired. It does not render a laid-out document to PDF (see DocWright.Renderers.Pdf) and does not import into the editable document model. Most users should install the DocWright package instead, which includes this one.",
